              "units": 1.0,
              "field_type": "choice",
              "options": [
                "Pending assessment",
                "Minor - internal only",
                "Moderate - client impact",
                "Major - commitment at risk",
                "Critical - cannot deliver as sold"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "guidance": "Severity describes the effect on the client commitment, not how the failure looks internally."
        }
      ]
    },
