        {
          "key": "record_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Record boundary for this report",
          "guidance": "This report is an internal process record. Keep it to observed facts, record states, dates, and actions taken. Do not record health information, conclusions about legal liability, admissions on behalf of the venue, or statements about individual staff discipline. Personnel and legal matters belong in the channels required by applicable policy."
        }
