            "Affected client contacted by the responsible manager",
            "Alternate date, space, or configuration offered in writing",
            "Accounting notified where a deposit or billing route was affected",
            "Accessibility or allergen request re-confirmed with the responsible manager",
            "Every department holding the affected order notified of the change",
            "Capacity and egress limits re-confirmed for any substituted space"
          ],
          "guidance": "An unticked action is an open containment gap, not an optional step."
