          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Stop conditions and authority boundary",
          "guidance": "Stop and route the matter to the responsible manager before promising any remedy, before changing a contracted term, and whenever the incident touches capacity or egress limits, an accessibility accommodation, an allergen requirement, a deposit or refund, or an insurance question. This report does not determine liability, approve a refund, or substitute for the review that applicable policy requires."
